/* ===================== v92: management overview + eligibility with two allowance categories =====================
   1  Position & level: Senior Proficient and above (always including Manager, Senior Manager, GM, VP) → not eligible;
      missing / unconfirmed / unmapped level → needs verification; below → assessed on actual duties.
   2  Duty classification, recorded from documented duties (never from the job title):
        technical support (OMR 50)  ·  specialised technical work (OMR 100)  ·  overlapping / not documented → needs
        classification review, and no amount is assumed.
   3  The category's existing conditions: support allowance — direct technical or administrative support to
      technicians; specialised allowance — customer contact + task criterion, combined as HR defines.
   The category definitions are the classification rules supplied for this page, not an official policy text.
   Display only: no requests, no approvals; nothing here changes an allowance record, amount, status or beneficiary. */
